          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "幾位早期羅馬人爭辯共和政體能否真正延續過其奠基者。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "By 476 AD, the last western Roman emperor had been deposed by a Germanic chieftain.",
          "highlight": [
            "Roman"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "公元 476 年，西羅馬最後一任皇帝被日耳曼酋長廢黜。"
          }
